Package: xreader
Architecture: any
Depends:
 libxreaderdocument3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libxreaderview3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 shared-mime-info,
 xapp-symbolic-icons,
 xreader-common (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: gvfs, yelp
Suggests: poppler-data
Provides: djvu-viewer, pdf-viewer, postscript-viewer
Description: document viewer for PDF, PostScript and other formats
 Xreader can display and print PDF, PostScript, DjVu, DVI, TIFF and XPS
 documents, as well as comic book archives. It supports searching,
 text selection, hyperlinks and bookmarks where the document format permits.

Package: xreader-common
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: architecture independent files for Xreader
 Xreader is a GTK document viewer for PDF and other formats.
 .
 This package contains translations, help, icons and thumbnailer metadata.

Package: libxreaderdocument3
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: document rendering library for Xreader
 This library loads documents and provides rendering backends for Xreader.

Package: libxreaderview3
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libxreaderdocument3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: document viewing library for Xreader
 This library implements the GTK document view used by Xreader.

